Part 4 – Left Panel Detailed Reference
________________________________________
4.1 Network Dashboard
Displays real-time statistics:
Network Metrics
Metric	Description
Total Pipes	All pipes in model
Boundary Pipes	Pipes identified as boundaries
Zone↔Zone	Boundaries between two zones
Zone↔Outside	Boundaries to unassigned areas
Connectivity
Metric	Description
Zone Pairs	Unique zone combinations
Average Connections	Open boundaries per zone pair
